Source: hdr-histogram
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), zlib1g-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/vovcke/pg_hdr_histogram

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-hdr-histogram
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-hdr-histogram
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: HDR histogram type and mergeable percentile aggregates
 Stores compressed HDR histograms as a PostgreSQL type and provides aggregates
 and scalar functions to build, merge and query bounded-error percentiles.
 Includes the vendored HdrHistogram_c implementation.
